s-west and eu-west on the broken version.\n- I retried, and the second attempt completed in all three regions.\n- Verified: all regions on v2.3.0, service healthy, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api describing the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current healthy state, and follow-ups (root-cause v2.3.1; investigate the orchestrator error). The create call timed out, but I confirmed via the incident list that it was created exactly once, so I did not retry.\n\n**Note:** I did not redeploy v2.3.1 or any other version \u2014 just the rollback. The orchestrator error on the first rollback attempt is worth a look by the platform team since it could affect future emergency rollbacks.", "type": "text"}]}]}